## 1. สถาปัตยกรรมโดยรวม

### 🏗️ Component Hierarchy

```
RootLayout (layout.tsx)
    ↓
    HTML/Font Setup + Global CSS
    ↓
Home Page (page.tsx)
    ↓
Dashboard (Dashboard.tsx) ← Main Controller
    ├── Sidebar (Sidebar.tsx) ← Navigation
    └── Main Content Area
        ├── DashboardPage
        ├── AnalyticsPage
        ├── UsersPage
        ├── ContentPage
        ├── AICoachPage
        ├── RevenuePage
        ├── NotificationsPage
        └── SettingsPage
```

### 🔄 Data Architecture

```
Browser (React Component)
    ↓ (ใช้ Hook)
Custom Hooks (useDashboardData, useAnalyticsData, etc.)
    ↓ (Query Data)
Supabase Client (supabase.ts)
    ↓ (Network Request)
Supabase Database
    ↓ (Response)
Hook returns { data, loading, error }
    ↓ (Render)
UI Components display data
```

### 📦 Technology Stack

| Layer | Technology | Version |
|-------|-----------|---------|
| **Framework** | Next.js | 16.2.1 |
| **Frontend** | React | 19.2.4 |
| **Styling** | Tailwind CSS | 4 |
| **Icons** | Lucide React | 0.577.0 |
| **Charts** | Recharts | 3.8.0 |
| **Database** | Supabase | 2.99.3 |
| **Language** | TypeScript | 5 |

